        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">The most common budget mistake is spending 100% on scaling existing winners and 0% on testing new creative. This works until your winners fatigue (which, <a href="/ad-fatigue/" class="text-accent hover:underline">as we&rsquo;ve covered</a>, takes ~10 days on Meta). Then you have no replacements ready and CPA spikes while you scramble to produce new creative. The fix: a permanent, non-negotiable testing budget.</p>

