        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4"><strong>The testing ROI math.</strong> If your testing budget is $3,000/month and you find 2 new winners per month that each generate $10,000 in profitable revenue before fatiguing, the ROI on testing spend is 6.7&times;. Testing budget isn&rsquo;t a cost &mdash; it&rsquo;s the investment that produces your future revenue. Cutting testing budget to save money is like a farmer eating their seed corn.</p>
